  "content": "<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">■ - <strong>Medieval Style Lootr</strong> 是一个资源包，让 Lootr 的外观更加清新，并带有铜/黄铜/中世纪/蒸汽朋克风格！主要支持版本为 <strong>1.19.2。</strong><br>■ - <strong>原版模组：</strong> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lootr\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lootr</a><br>■ - <strong>艺术家：</strong> Black Aures 和 nocubeyt</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">■ 原版：<img src=\"https://github.com/BlackAures1/image_lib/blob/main/small_mods/2023-05-29_19.56.20.png?raw=true\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">■ 我的纹理包：</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/BlackAures1/image_lib/blob/main/small_mods/2023-05-29_19.54.35.png?raw=true\" alt=\"\"></p>",
